        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DesktopPasture is a Low Poly stylized idle-pasture simulator designed to sit at the bottom of your screen allowing you to work on other tasks while caring for your pasture and animals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516640/extras/5e68fa96eea38fe884a23bc2358f5e98.poster.avif?t=1772945209\" width=602 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516640/extras/5e68fa96eea38fe884a23bc2358f5e98.webm?t=1772945209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516640/extras/5e68fa96eea38fe884a23bc2358f5e98.mp4?t=1772945209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow fresh organic veggies on your desktop to feed animals and hire harvesters for hands-free farming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516640/extras/5ba2b267a5f9a68391fd27b3cd157358.poster.avif?t=1772945209\" width=674 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516640/extras/5ba2b267a5f9a68391fd27b3cd157358.webm?t=1772945209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516640/extras/5ba2b267a5f9a68391fd27b3cd157358.mp4?t=1772945209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Switch Stunning Stylized Scenes Instantly ,Support Workshop </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516640/extras/02fd2a1d3fcb3a49660da43d7ae64fc8.poster.avif?t=1772945209\" width=672 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516640/extras/02fd2a1d3fcb3a49660da43d7ae64fc8.webm?t=1772945209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516640/extras/02fd2a1d3fcb3a49660da43d7ae64fc8.mp4?t=1772945209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​​Bottom-Screen Design:​​ Allows for effortless play while you work or study.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​​Diverse Animal Selection:​​ Choose and raise dozens of adorable animals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​​Enhanced Animal Interaction:​​ Interact with cute critters to earn more coins and profits, expanding your ranch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Decorations &amp; Effects:​​ Dozens of fun decorations and environmental effects, with Workshop support , help you create your own serene and delightful paradise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​​Farming System:​​ Cultivate various crops on your ranch, enjoy the fun of sowing and harvesting, and provide fresh organic fruits and vegetables for your animals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​​Backgrounds:​​ Choose from different pasture background environments to suit your preference, with Workshop support.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​​Optimized Resource Usage:​​ Engineered for minimal computer resource consumption.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​​Compatibility:​​ Compatible with other software and live wallpapers (can run concurrently).</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DesktopPasture is a Low Poly stylized idle-pasture simulator designed to sit at the bottom of your screen allowing you to work on other tasks while caring for your pasture and animals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516640/extras/5e68fa96eea38fe884a23bc2358f5e98.poster.avif?t=1772945209\" width=602 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516640/extras/5e68fa96eea38fe884a23bc2358f5e98.webm?t=1772945209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516640/extras/5e68fa96eea38fe884a23bc2358f5e98.mp4?t=1772945209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow fresh organic veggies on your desktop to feed animals and hire harvesters for hands-free farming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516640/extras/5ba2b267a5f9a68391fd27b3cd157358.poster.avif?t=1772945209\" width=674 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516640/extras/5ba2b267a5f9a68391fd27b3cd157358.webm?t=1772945209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516640/extras/5ba2b267a5f9a68391fd27b3cd157358.mp4?t=1772945209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Switch Stunning Stylized Scenes Instantly ,Support Workshop </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516640/extras/02fd2a1d3fcb3a49660da43d7ae64fc8.poster.avif?t=1772945209\" width=672 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516640/extras/02fd2a1d3fcb3a49660da43d7ae64fc8.webm?t=1772945209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516640/extras/02fd2a1d3fcb3a49660da43d7ae64fc8.mp4?t=1772945209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​​Bottom-Screen Design:​​ Allows for effortless play while you work or study.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​​Diverse Animal Selection:​​ Choose and raise dozens of adorable animals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​​Enhanced Animal Interaction:​​ Interact with cute critters to earn more coins and profits, expanding your ranch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Decorations &amp; Effects:​​ Dozens of fun decorations and environmental effects, with Workshop support , help you create your own serene and delightful paradise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​​Farming System:​​ Cultivate various crops on your ranch, enjoy the fun of sowing and harvesting, and provide fresh organic fruits and vegetables for your animals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​​Backgrounds:​​ Choose from different pasture background environments to suit your preference, with Workshop support.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​​Optimized Resource Usage:​​ Engineered for minimal computer resource consumption.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >​​Compatibility:​​ Compatible with other software and live wallpapers (can run concurrently).</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "A Low Poly stylized idle-pasture simulator designed to sit at the bottom of your screen allowing you to work on other tasks while caring for your pasture and animals!",
